  "prefLabel": "Vet 803.01 Students in a Veterinary Technician Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 803.01 Students in a Veterinary Technician Program. A person who is a student in an AVMA accredited veterinary technology program or a post-secondary pre-veterinary program may perform the tasks described in Vet 802.01 while working under the immediate supervision of a credentialed veterinary nurse or veterinary technician assuming the appropriate level of veterinary supervision as outlined in Vet 802.\n\nSource. #13577, eff 5-15-23; ss by #14666, eff 10-27-26, EXPIRES: 10-27-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/vet100-1000.html"
